WEBVTT

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.085
they were not there a few decades ago.

00:01:33.577 --> 00:01:35.164
Those lines that are there today,

00:01:35.188 --> 00:01:37.942
those flags were created
because somebody said,

00:01:37.966 --> 00:01:39.458
"the Scotts are not like us,"

00:01:39.482 --> 00:01:40.823
"the Welsh are not like us,"

00:01:40.847 --> 00:01:42.288
"the Basques are not like us,"

00:01:42.312 --> 00:01:44.233
"the northern Italians are not like us,"

00:01:44.257 --> 00:01:45.736
"the Muslims are not like us,"

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:48.360
the blacks, the whites, the Christians.

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:51.176
You create "us versus them" ...

00:01:52.347 --> 00:01:53.910
you destroy nations.

00:01:55.173 --> 00:01:57.426
Part of the problem
from creating us versus them

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.717
is it's hard to do.